# Cabeçalhos HTTP para hospedagens estáticas que leem o arquivo "_headers"
# (Cloudflare Pages e Netlify). Em outras hospedagens (Vercel, Apache, Nginx),
# configure os mesmos cabeçalhos no painel/arquivo de configuração.
#
# Teste antes de publicar: abra o site e confira o console do navegador. Se aparecer
# "Refused to ... because it violates the Content-Security-Policy", ajuste a política abaixo.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'

/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate

/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
